creener.com/v2/announcements/view/11693665","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-12-10","type":"agm","what":"第21届常年股东大会","what_en":"21st Annual General Meeting","ann":"11696921","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11696921","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-12-10","type":"agm","what":"第21届常年股东大会","what_en":"21st Annual General Meeting","ann":"11693665","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11693665","src":"ai"}],"recent_en":"P.A. Resources secured RM255.45 million in banking facilities in September 2026 for expansion. It also reported strong quarterly results for the period ended 30 June 2026, with significant growth in revenue and net profit, and declared an interim dividend. Meanwhile, the company continued to issue new shares from ESOS exercises and saw several changes in board and committee memberships.","notable_en":["Secured RM255.45 million in banking facilities for expansion.","4Q FY2026 net profit grew about 200% year-on-year, and declared an interim dividend of 0.5 sen per share.","Issued and listed new shares multiple times due to employees exercising ESOS options."],"risks_en":["Director Wong Jee Seng exercised 2.4 million options, increasing his direct shareholding.","Continued ESOS option exercises have led to gradual share capital expansion."],"earnings_en":"For the quarter ended 30 June 2026, revenue was RM204.832 million, up 38.3% QoQ and 25.2% YoY; net profit was RM18.0 million, up 438.4% QoQ and 200.2% YoY; net margin improved to 8.8% from 2.3% in the previous quarter."}